<li>Open the Thawani merchant portal → <b>Developers</b> and copy your publishable and secret keys. <a href="https://www.s4d.om/knowledgebase/1/Thawani-Getting-API-Keys.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">How to get the API keys</a></li>
<li>For test mode, use the UAT keys from the <a href="https://thawani-technologies.stoplight.io/docs/thawani-ecommerce-api/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Thawani Checkout API docs</a>.</li>
<li>If your store doesn't use Omani Rial, set the <b>Exchange Rate</b> to OMR (for example 0.385 for USD).</li>
